DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Vector");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle 4, 20, 10 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 14, 18, 4 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{u} \cdot \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<4, 20, 10>") . Compute("<14, 18, 4>")}
- Enter a unit vector in the direction of [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{unit(Compute("<14, 18, 4>"))}
- [` \vec{u} \times \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<4, 20, 10>") x Compute("<14, 18, 4>")}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<4, 20, 10>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<4, 20, 10>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- [` \left\| \vec{u} \right\| = `] [_____]{norm(Compute("<4, 20, 10>"))}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle 19, 12, 12 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 3, 16, 1 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{w} = \langle 12, 18, 12 \rangle `]

Compute:
- Enter a unit vector in the direction of [` \vec{w} `]. [_____]{unit(Compute("<12, 18, 12>"))}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{w} `]. [_____]{Compute("<12, 18, 12>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- [` \vec{w} \cdot \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<12, 18, 12>") . Compute("<3, 16, 1>")}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<3, 16, 1>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<3, 16, 1>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle 4, 19, 10 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 20, 7, 12 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{v} \times \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<20, 7, 12>") x Compute("<4, 19, 10>")}
- [` \vec{v} \cdot \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<20, 7, 12>") . Compute("<4, 19, 10>")}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<20, 7, 12>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<4, 19, 10>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
